invariant: INV-53
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: test-invariants-not-proof-backed stops passing VIOLATION_SHARD to
  test/violations.py, so each of the four test-invariants jobs checks the
  whole class and runs out of time, as the one job did. lint-matrix reads
  the recipe of the make target that each sharded step runs.

--- old
	+python3 test/violations.py --not-proof-backed --jobs $(VIOLATION_JOBS) \
	  $(if $(VIOLATION_SHARD),--shard=$(VIOLATION_SHARD))
--- new
	+python3 test/violations.py --not-proof-backed --jobs $(VIOLATION_JOBS)
